MODULE: OfferedLoadRespondsReceiverIgnoresSaturation
TARGET: OfferedLoadResponds
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the receiver never reduces offered load under persistent saturation
PERTURBS: ReceiverShrinkBatch

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.receiver = ReceiverBatch(LogicalValue(1))]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: leave receiver offered load unchanged.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.receiver = FullBatch]
--- END
